.TH DJFORMAT 1
.SH NAME
djformat \- format a Morrow DJ\-DMA floppy diskette
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B djformat
device [ track ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I djformat
runs the controller's write\-track command across a diskette, one track
per ioctl, printing a line as each track is done.  The device node names
the drive.  A format blanks the diskette, so any filesystem goes with it
and
.IR mkfs (1)
follows.
.PP
With a
.I track
argument, only that one track is formatted.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B djformat /dev/fla
.SH "SEE ALSO"
mkfs(1), mwformat(1)
